---
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
---

<DocLayout title="Foundations" description="The concepts behind Farn — how the system thinks before you build with it">
  <h1>Foundations</h1>
  <p>
    Foundations is the concept layer. It explains <em>how Farn thinks</em> — the ideas and
    rationale behind the system — before you reach for specific token values. For the concrete
    values you look up while building, see <a href="/styles">Styles</a>.
  </p>

  <div class="card-grid">

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/foundations/surfaces">
      <div class="card-media card-preview fo-preview-surfaces" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="surface-swatch" data-surface="base"><span>base</span></div>
        <div class="surface-swatch" data-surface="layer"><span>layer</span></div>
        <div class="surface-swatch" data-surface="overlay"><span>overlay</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Surfaces</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">The theme + depth model — <code>data-theme</code> and <code>data-surface</code> — and how it aligns with the palette.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/foundations/layout">
      <div class="card-media card-preview fo-preview-layout" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="preview-bar-list">
          <div class="layout-bar layout-bar-nav"></div>
          <div class="layout-bar layout-bar-content"></div>
          <div class="layout-bar layout-bar-prose"></div>
          <div class="layout-bar layout-bar-footer"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Layout</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Content-first widths, page structure, and grid-vs-flex guidance.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/foundations/responsive">
      <div class="card-media card-preview fo-preview-responsive" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="preview-bar-list">
          <div class="resp-row">
            <div class="resp-bar resp-bar-full"></div>
            <span class="resp-label">all</span>
          </div>
          <div class="resp-row">
            <div class="resp-bar resp-bar-tablet"></div>
            <span class="resp-label">≤960px</span>
          </div>
          <div class="resp-row">
            <div class="resp-bar resp-bar-mobile"></div>
            <span class="resp-label">≤640px</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Responsive</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Breakpoint tokens and the reflow-by-content philosophy.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/foundations/accessibility">
      <div class="card-media card-preview fo-preview-a11y" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="a11y-demo">
          <button class="a11y-focus-btn" tabindex="-1">Focus visible</button>
          <div class="a11y-contrast-pair">
            <span class="a11y-on-dark">Aa</span>
            <span class="a11y-on-light">Aa</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Accessibility</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Farn's WCAG AA commitment, focus styles, and reduced-motion approach.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

  </div>

  <p>
    Contrast data for all semantic token pairs lives on <a href="/foundations/accessibility">Foundations › Accessibility</a>.
  </p>
</DocLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Surfaces preview ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .fo-preview-surfaces {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2xs, 4px);
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .surface-swatch {
    flex: 1;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 var(--space-sm);
  }
  .surface-swatch span {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* ── Layout + Responsive previews ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .fo-preview-layout {
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .preview-bar-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0 var(--space-xs);
  }
  .layout-bar {
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-border);
  }
  .layout-bar-nav     { width: 100%; }
  .layout-bar-content { width: 80%; background: var(--color-accent); opacity: 0.7; height: 14px; }
  .layout-bar-prose   { width: 60%; }
  .layout-bar-footer  { width: 100%; opacity: 0.4; }

  /* ── Responsive preview ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .resp-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .resp-bar {
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-accent);
    opacity: 0.65;
  }
  .resp-bar-full   { width: 100%; }
  .resp-bar-tablet { width: 66%; }
  .resp-bar-mobile { width: 40%; }
  .resp-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ── Accessibility preview ─────────────────────────────────────────── */

  .a11y-demo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .a11y-focus-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg-panel);
    color: var(--color-text);
    cursor: default;
    /* Forced focus ring — static demo, not interactive */
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .a11y-contrast-pair {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .a11y-on-dark,
  .a11y-on-light {
    width: 2.4rem;
    height: 2.4rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .a11y-on-dark  { background: var(--in0-void);   color: var(--bm2-birch); }
  .a11y-on-light { background: var(--bm2-birch);  color: var(--in0-void); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
</style>
